Package: vgSalesAnalyzer
Type: Package
Title: Video Game Sales Analyzer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alen", "Abraham", email = "Alenjaks123@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package analyzes data from more than 16,500 games. It provides
    information such as platform, year of release, genre, publisher, and regional
    sales. The goal is to explore sales trends over time and understand patterns
    across different markets.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr
License: CC0 1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/AlenjaksAbraham/vgSalesAnalyzer